# port.sov — x86 I/O ports and CPU control.
# FREESTANDING/KERNEL ONLY: these are privileged and will
# fault inside a normal Linux program. Use in Sovren OS code.
#
# port_out8 p v   send one byte to an I/O port
# port_in8 p      read one byte from an I/O port
# cli / sti       disable / enable interrupts
# hlt             halt until next interrupt
